msgid "Move them to On hold now and restore them when I reactivate"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Deactivation.php:161
msgid "Every order gets a note, is moved to On hold and stays visible in WooCommerce. Nothing else changes: no emails are sent and stock levels, sales counts and coupon usage stay as they are. Large shops see a progress page; keep it open until it finishes. When you activate the plugin again, each order that is still in On hold returns to its previous status in the background. An order whose status you changed in the meantime keeps its new status."
